a:9:{s:19:"attachments-handler";a:2:{i:0;s:618:"<p><b>Attachments Handler</b></p><p>The Wordpress page: <a href='http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/attachments-handler'>http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/attachments-handler</a></p><p>Last update: 2016-04-17</p><div class='inline'>Rating: 100 &nbsp; &nbsp; </div> <div class='star-holder inline'><div class='star star-rating' style='width: 100px'></div><div class='star star5'></div><div class='star star4'></div><div class='star star3'></div><div class='star star2'></div><div class='star star1'></div></div>  <div class='inline'> &nbsp; (by 1 persons)</div><br class='clearBoth' /><p>Number of download: 2383</p>";i:1;s:1178:"<div class='description_wordpress'><p>Enables the supervision of your attachement, detects duplicates, detects unused files.</p>
<p>You may also create a list of all attached file in the page or in the child pages by using the following shorcode [attach child=1 only_admin=1 title=&#8217;Title you want&#8217; extension=&#8217;pdf,doc,png&#8217;].</p>
</div><div style='padding-left:10px ; '><div class='screenshot_wordpress'><a href="https://ps.w.org/attachments-handler/trunk/screenshot-1.png?rev=1539388"><img src="https://ps.w.org/attachments-handler/trunk/screenshot-1.png?rev=1539388" alt="Issue detection"></a><p>Issue detection</p></div><div class='screenshot_wordpress'><a href="https://ps.w.org/attachments-handler/trunk/screenshot-2.png?rev=1539388"><img src="https://ps.w.org/attachments-handler/trunk/screenshot-2.png?rev=1539388" alt="All links"></a><p>All links</p></div><div class='screenshot_wordpress'><a href="https://ps.w.org/attachments-handler/trunk/screenshot-3.png?rev=1539388"><img src="https://ps.w.org/attachments-handler/trunk/screenshot-3.png?rev=1539388" alt="Parameter screen"></a><p>Parameter screen</p></div><div style='clear:both;'></div></div>";}s:16:"automatic-ban-ip";a:2:{i:0;s:609:"<p><b>Automatic Ban IP</b></p><p>The Wordpress page: <a href='http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/automatic-ban-ip'>http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/automatic-ban-ip</a></p><p>Last update: 2016-04-17</p><div class='inline'>Rating: 100 &nbsp; &nbsp; </div> <div class='star-holder inline'><div class='star star-rating' style='width: 100px'></div><div class='star star5'></div><div class='star star4'></div><div class='star star3'></div><div class='star star2'></div><div class='star star1'></div></div>  <div class='inline'> &nbsp; (by 2 persons)</div><br class='clearBoth' /><p>Number of download: 4487</p>";i:1;s:1434:"<div class='description_wordpress'><p>Block IP addresses which are suspicious and try to post on your blog spam comments.</p>
<p>This plugin need that you create an account on the Honey Pot Project (https://www.projecthoneypot.org, free api) or that you install the Spam Captcha plugin.</p>
<p>In addition, if you want to geolocate the spammers your may create an account on (http://ipinfodb.com/, free api). Thus, you may display a world map with the concentration of spammers.</p>
<p>Spammers may be blocked either by PHP based restrictions (i.e. WordPress generates a 403 page for such identified users) or by Apache based restriction (using Deny from in .htaccess file).</p>
<p>The Apache restriction is far more efficient when hundreds of hosts sent you spams in few minutes.</p>
</div><div style='padding-left:10px ; '><div class='screenshot_wordpress'><a href="https://ps.w.org/automatic-ban-ip/trunk/screenshot-1.png?rev=1539014"><img src="https://ps.w.org/automatic-ban-ip/trunk/screenshot-1.png?rev=1539014" alt="The world map of banned spammers"></a><p>The world map of banned spammers</p></div><div class='screenshot_wordpress'><a href="https://ps.w.org/automatic-ban-ip/trunk/screenshot-2.png?rev=1539014"><img src="https://ps.w.org/automatic-ban-ip/trunk/screenshot-2.png?rev=1539014" alt="An extract of list of banned spammers"></a><p>An extract of list of banned spammers</p></div><div style='clear:both;'></div></div>";}s:12:"enable-latex";a:2:{i:0;s:597:"<p><b>Enable Latex</b></p><p>The Wordpress page: <a href='http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/enable-latex'>http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/enable-latex</a></p><p>Last update: 2016-04-17</p><div class='inline'>Rating: 100 &nbsp; &nbsp; </div> <div class='star-holder inline'><div class='star star-rating' style='width: 100px'></div><div class='star star5'></div><div class='star star4'></div><div class='star star3'></div><div class='star star2'></div><div class='star star1'></div></div>  <div class='inline'> &nbsp; (by 2 persons)</div><br class='clearBoth' /><p>Number of download: 8054</p>";i:1;s:1160:"<div class='description_wordpress'><p>Insert LaTeX formulas in your posts.</p>
<p>Just type [latex size=0 color=000000 background=ffffff]&#092;&#092;displaystyle f_{rec} = &#092;&#092;frac{c+v_{mobile}}{c} f_{em}[/latex] in your post to show the LaTeX formula.</p>
<p>You can configure:</p>
<ul>
<li>the color of the font,  </li>
<li>the color of the background, </li>
<li>the style of the image displayed. </li>
</ul>
<p>Plugin developped from the orginal plugin WP-LaTeX.</p>
<p>This plugin is under GPL licence.</p>
</div><div style='padding-left:10px ; '><div class='screenshot_wordpress'><a href="https://ps.w.org/enable-latex/trunk/screenshot-1.jpg?rev=1539038"><img src="https://ps.w.org/enable-latex/trunk/screenshot-1.jpg?rev=1539038" alt="The configuration page of the plugin"></a><p>The configuration page of the plugin</p></div><div class='screenshot_wordpress'><a href="https://ps.w.org/enable-latex/trunk/screenshot-2.jpg?rev=1539038"><img src="https://ps.w.org/enable-latex/trunk/screenshot-2.jpg?rev=1539038" alt="An example of LaTex formula in a post"></a><p>An example of LaTex formula in a post</p></div><div style='clear:both;'></div></div>";}s:20:"formatting-correcter";a:2:{i:0;s:621:"<p><b>Formatting correcter</b></p><p>The Wordpress page: <a href='http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/formatting-correcter'>http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/formatting-correcter</a></p><p>Last update: 2016-04-17</p><div class='inline'>Rating: 100 &nbsp; &nbsp; </div> <div class='star-holder inline'><div class='star star-rating' style='width: 100px'></div><div class='star star5'></div><div class='star star4'></div><div class='star star3'></div><div class='star star2'></div><div class='star star1'></div></div>  <div class='inline'> &nbsp; (by 4 persons)</div><br class='clearBoth' /><p>Number of download: 3172</p>";i:1;s:1057:"<div class='description_wordpress'><p>The plugin detects any formatting issues in your posts such as &#8220;double space&#8221; or any other issues that you may configure and proposes to correct them accordingly.</p>
</div><div style='padding-left:10px ; '><div class='screenshot_wordpress'><a href="https://ps.w.org/formatting-correcter/trunk/screenshot-1.png?rev=1539073"><img src="https://ps.w.org/formatting-correcter/trunk/screenshot-1.png?rev=1539073" alt="Results page"></a><p>Results page</p></div><div class='screenshot_wordpress'><a href="https://ps.w.org/formatting-correcter/trunk/screenshot-2.png?rev=1539073"><img src="https://ps.w.org/formatting-correcter/trunk/screenshot-2.png?rev=1539073" alt="Modification page"></a><p>Modification page</p></div><div class='screenshot_wordpress'><a href="https://ps.w.org/formatting-correcter/trunk/screenshot-3.png?rev=1539073"><img src="https://ps.w.org/formatting-correcter/trunk/screenshot-3.png?rev=1539073" alt="Parameters page"></a><p>Parameters page</p></div><div style='clear:both;'></div></div>";}s:15:"links-synthesis";a:2:{i:0;s:606:"<p><b>Links synthesis</b></p><p>The Wordpress page: <a href='http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/links-synthesis'>http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/links-synthesis</a></p><p>Last update: 2016-04-18</p><div class='inline'>Rating: 100 &nbsp; &nbsp; </div> <div class='star-holder inline'><div class='star star-rating' style='width: 100px'></div><div class='star star5'></div><div class='star star4'></div><div class='star star3'></div><div class='star star2'></div><div class='star star1'></div></div>  <div class='inline'> &nbsp; (by 1 persons)</div><br class='clearBoth' /><p>Number of download: 2250</p>";i:1;s:1387:"<div class='description_wordpress'><p>This plugin enables a synthesis of all links and the creation of thumbnail for links in an article and retrieves data from them.</p>
<p>In this plugin, an index of all links in the page/post is created at the end of the page/post.</p>
<p>In addition, each link is periodically check to see if the link is still valid.</p>
<p>p&gt;In addition, each link is periodically check to see if the link is still valid.</p>
<p>You may display a thumbnail of the URL when the user move its mouse over the link.</p>
<p>This plugin is under GPL licence.</p>
</div><div style='padding-left:10px ; '><div class='screenshot_wordpress'><a href="https://ps.w.org/links-synthesis/trunk/screenshot-1.png?rev=1539323"><img src="https://ps.w.org/links-synthesis/trunk/screenshot-1.png?rev=1539323" alt="Links with issues"></a><p>Links with issues</p></div><div class='screenshot_wordpress'><a href="https://ps.w.org/links-synthesis/trunk/screenshot-2.png?rev=1539323"><img src="https://ps.w.org/links-synthesis/trunk/screenshot-2.png?rev=1539323" alt="All Links"></a><p>All Links</p></div><div class='screenshot_wordpress'><a href="https://ps.w.org/links-synthesis/trunk/screenshot-3.png?rev=1539323"><img src="https://ps.w.org/links-synthesis/trunk/screenshot-3.png?rev=1539323" alt="Some parameters"></a><p>Some parameters</p></div><div style='clear:both;'></div></div>";}s:12:"list-plugins";a:2:{i:0;s:595:"<p><b>List Plugins</b></p><p>The Wordpress page: <a href='http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/list-plugins'>http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/list-plugins</a></p><p>Last update: 2016-04-18</p><div class='inline'>Rating: 80 &nbsp; &nbsp; </div> <div class='star-holder inline'><div class='star star-rating' style='width: 80px'></div><div class='star star5'></div><div class='star star4'></div><div class='star star3'></div><div class='star star2'></div><div class='star star1'></div></div>  <div class='inline'> &nbsp; (by 4 persons)</div><br class='clearBoth' /><p>Number of download: 7889</p>";i:1;s:813:"<div class='description_wordpress'><p>Create a list of the active plugins in a page (when the shortcode [list_plugins] is found).</p>
<p>The list may contain:</p>
<ul>
<li>the name of the plugin, </li>
<li>the description, </li>
<li>the version, </li>
<li>the screenshots,</li>
<li>a link to download the zip file of the current version.</li>
</ul>
<p>Plugin developped from the orginal plugin WP-PluginsUsed.</p>
<p>This plugin is under GPL licence.</p>
</div><div style='padding-left:10px ; '><div class='screenshot_wordpress'><a href="https://ps.w.org/list-plugins/trunk/screenshot-1.png?rev=1539081"><img src="https://ps.w.org/list-plugins/trunk/screenshot-1.png?rev=1539081" alt="The configuration page of the plugin"></a><p>The configuration page of the plugin</p></div><div style='clear:both;'></div></div>";}s:11:"pages-order";a:2:{i:0;s:593:"<p><b>Pages Order</b></p><p>The Wordpress page: <a href='http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/pages-order'>http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/pages-order</a></p><p>Last update: 2016-04-18</p><div class='inline'>Rating: 60 &nbsp; &nbsp; </div> <div class='star-holder inline'><div class='star star-rating' style='width: 60px'></div><div class='star star5'></div><div class='star star4'></div><div class='star star3'></div><div class='star star2'></div><div class='star star1'></div></div>  <div class='inline'> &nbsp; (by 2 persons)</div><br class='clearBoth' /><p>Number of download: 15803</p>";i:1;s:1443:"<div class='description_wordpress'><p>With this plugin, you may re-order the order of the pages and the hierarchical order of the pages.</p>
<p>Moreover, you may add this hierarchy into your page to ease the navigation of viewers into your website</p>
</div><div style='padding-left:10px ; '><div class='screenshot_wordpress'><a href="https://ps.w.org/pages-order/trunk/screenshot-1.png?rev=1538857"><img src="https://ps.w.org/pages-order/trunk/screenshot-1.png?rev=1538857" alt="The tree view in the admin dashboard"></a><p>The tree view in the admin dashboard</p></div><div class='screenshot_wordpress'><a href="https://ps.w.org/pages-order/trunk/screenshot-2.png?rev=1538857"><img src="https://ps.w.org/pages-order/trunk/screenshot-2.png?rev=1538857" alt="The configuration page"></a><p>The configuration page</p></div><div class='screenshot_wordpress'><a href="https://ps.w.org/pages-order/trunk/screenshot-3.png?rev=1538857"><img src="https://ps.w.org/pages-order/trunk/screenshot-3.png?rev=1538857" alt="The tree view displayed in the front pages"></a><p>The tree view displayed in the front pages</p></div><div class='screenshot_wordpress'><a href="https://ps.w.org/pages-order/trunk/screenshot-4.png?rev=1538857"><img src="https://ps.w.org/pages-order/trunk/screenshot-4.png?rev=1538857" alt="The breadcrumb displayed in the front pages"></a><p>The breadcrumb displayed in the front pages</p></div><div style='clear:both;'></div></div>";}s:15:"plagiary-search";a:2:{i:0;s:606:"<p><b>Plagiary Search</b></p><p>The Wordpress page: <a href='http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/plagiary-search'>http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/plagiary-search</a></p><p>Last update: 2016-04-18</p><div class='inline'>Rating: 100 &nbsp; &nbsp; </div> <div class='star-holder inline'><div class='star star-rating' style='width: 100px'></div><div class='star star5'></div><div class='star star4'></div><div class='star star3'></div><div class='star star2'></div><div class='star star1'></div></div>  <div class='inline'> &nbsp; (by 1 persons)</div><br class='clearBoth' /><p>Number of download: 4006</p>";i:1;s:853:"<div class='description_wordpress'><p>Find websites that copy/paste your content without authorization.</p>
<p>In addition, you will avoid to include involuntary plagiarism in your articles.</p>
<p>This plugin is under GPL licence.</p>
</div><div style='padding-left:10px ; '><div class='screenshot_wordpress'><a href="https://ps.w.org/plagiary-search/trunk/screenshot-1.png?rev=1539147"><img src="https://ps.w.org/plagiary-search/trunk/screenshot-1.png?rev=1539147" alt="Examples of results with proximity images"></a><p>Examples of results with proximity images</p></div><div class='screenshot_wordpress'><a href="https://ps.w.org/plagiary-search/trunk/screenshot-2.png?rev=1539147"><img src="https://ps.w.org/plagiary-search/trunk/screenshot-2.png?rev=1539147" alt="Process screen"></a><p>Process screen</p></div><div style='clear:both;'></div></div>";}s:14:"update-message";a:2:{i:0;s:603:"<p><b>Update Message</b></p><p>The Wordpress page: <a href='http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/update-message'>http://wordpress.org/extend/plugins/update-message</a></p><p>Last update: 2016-04-20</p><div class='inline'>Rating: 100 &nbsp; &nbsp; </div> <div class='star-holder inline'><div class='star star-rating' style='width: 100px'></div><div class='star star5'></div><div class='star star4'></div><div class='star star3'></div><div class='star star2'></div><div class='star star1'></div></div>  <div class='inline'> &nbsp; (by 3 persons)</div><br class='clearBoth' /><p>Number of download: 6918</p>";i:1;s:1509:"<div class='description_wordpress'><p>Add an update box in posts.</p>
<p>This box can contain a message, for instance in order to point out that the post have been modified of to stress that the post in no longer up to date</p>
<p>The message can be configured direcly when editing a post. There is a box &#8216;Update message&#8217; added on the left.</p>
<p>In addition, you may use a shortcode [maj update=&#8217;dd/mm/yy&#8217; expire=&#8217;dd/mm/yy&#8217;]xxx[/maj]</p>
<p>Plugin developped from the orginal plugin WP Update Message.</p>
<p>This plugin is under GPL licence.</p>
</div><div style='padding-left:10px ; '><div class='screenshot_wordpress'><a href="https://ps.w.org/update-message/trunk/screenshot-1.png?rev=1539087"><img src="https://ps.w.org/update-message/trunk/screenshot-1.png?rev=1539087" alt="The configuration page of the plugin"></a><p>The configuration page of the plugin</p></div><div class='screenshot_wordpress'><a href="https://ps.w.org/update-message/trunk/screenshot-2.png?rev=1539087"><img src="https://ps.w.org/update-message/trunk/screenshot-2.png?rev=1539087" alt="An example of an update box"></a><p>An example of an update box</p></div><div class='screenshot_wordpress'><a href="https://ps.w.org/update-message/trunk/screenshot-3.png?rev=1539087"><img src="https://ps.w.org/update-message/trunk/screenshot-3.png?rev=1539087" alt="Configuration of the update box in a post"></a><p>Configuration of the update box in a post</p></div><div style='clear:both;'></div></div>";}}